   "npc": "14725",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Hail friend - a moment of your time, if I may...\n\nWe have endured much in our trials and tribulations in establishing Teldrassil.  Were the constant strife of the times not enough, we now find ourselves in a dire shortage of cloth.  If you have the materials to spare, I ask that you please donate them.  You certainly would earn the gratitude of night elves everywhere in helping us out!",
   "time": 1792339513,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Darnassus"
  },
